238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (In our dedicated effort to enhance employee retention at Inklings, we initiated an in-depth analysis of the business. This comprehensive examination aimed to pinpoint existing challenges and areas of improvement within our current employee retention strategies. By delving into various aspects of our operations, work culture, and employee feedback, we identified specific pain points that may contribute to turnover. This thorough evaluation laid the groundwork for devising effective solutions tailored to address these challenges.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
239 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (To gauge the effectiveness of potential solutions, we strategically designed a survey with targeted questions. Some questions were crafted as forced-choice, requiring respondents to select from predetermined options. This approach allows for structured insights into preferred solutions and provides quantitative data that can guide decision-making. Additionally, we incorporated open-ended questions to encourage employees to share specific experiences, suggestions, and concerns. These qualitative responses offer a more nuanced understanding of the issues at hand, providing valuable context to complement the quantitative data.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
240 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Span
/K [6]
/Pg 16 0 R
/P 389 0 R
>>
endobj
241 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 139 0 R
/T (The synergy between forced-choice and open-ended questions ensures a well-rounded survey approach. It enables us to obtain both specific, conclusive data on preferred solutions and nuanced, qualitative insights that capture the intricacies of employee experiences. This methodological combination positions us to not only identify the most favored solutions from an employee's perspective but also to understand the underlying sentiments and perspectives that influence their choices.)
/E (The synergy between forced-choice and open-ended questions ensures a well-rounded survey approach. It enables us to obtain both specific, conclusive data on preferred solutions and nuanced, qualitative insights that capture the intricacies of employee experiences. This methodological combination positions us to not only identify the most favored solutions from an employee's perspective but also to understand the underlying sentiments and perspectives that influence their choices.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
