/Title (The synergy between forced-choice and open-ended questions ensures a well-rounded survey approach. It enables us to obtain both specific, conclusive data on preferred solutions and nuanced, qualitative insights that capture the intricacies of employee experiences. This methodological combination positions us to not only identify the most favored solutions from an employee's perspective but also to understand the underlying sentiments and perspectives that influence their choices.)
